CHAPTER.VERS:
Ye that put far away the 

          You that continue still in your wickedness, and think that God's plagues are not at hand, but give yourselves to all idleness, lustfulness, and disorder.
         evil day, and cause the seat of violence to come near;

That chant to the sound of the viol, [and] invent to themselves instruments of musick, like 

          As he caused different types of instruments to be made to serve God's glory, so these did strive to invent as many to serve their unrestrained affections and lusts.
         David;
